/-- **Theorem 2 (1⇉2⇉3) is one inner orbit.** `Φ_s` is a multiplicative bijection of the algebra with `Φ_s P_0 Φ_s⁻¹ = P_s`. -/
theorem thm2_one_orbit {k : Type*} [CommRing k] (s : k) :
